{
  "description": "Handwritten fences and the exact bounded epoch encoding: a canonical base-10 string from 1 to 999999999999999999 (18 digits). The largest epoch is accepted; the next acquisition after it refuses as epoch-exhausted; every overflowed, non-integer, signed, zero, padded or numeric epoch is refused before a check.",
